\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces F3: OLMoE BF16 validation exploration on the same 32 articles, with 32 genuine decode predictions each. Each batch size has one source execution; its points aggregate 32, four, or one cohort at $B=1,8,32$, respectively. Logical bytes and quality come from each policy's teacher-forced trajectory, with native dense counters as the common denominator. Lower right is preferable. Dashed frontiers are descriptive measured means, without task-accuracy or statistical-superiority claims.}}{7}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:quality-r06}{{2}{7}{F3: OLMoE BF16 validation exploration on the same 32 articles, with 32 genuine decode predictions each. Each batch size has one source execution; its points aggregate 32, four, or one cohort at $B=1,8,32$, respectively. Logical bytes and quality come from each policy's teacher-forced trajectory, with native dense counters as the common denominator. Lower right is preferable. Dashed frontiers are descriptive measured means, without task-accuracy or statistical-superiority claims}{figure.2}{}}
