\newlabel{fig:quality-fp8-r09}{{3}{8}{F3 in OLMoE FP8 W8A8: the same 32 validation articles and teacher-forced window protocol as BF16, evaluated against native FP8 separately at each batch size. The nonquantized model dtype remains BF16; routed weights/activations use FP8. Each point aggregates 1,024 scored decode predictions from one source execution. The independent sampling unit is the article, not a token or cohort. Lower right is preferable; the frontiers describe observed means, not task accuracy or an independent confirmation}{figure.3}{}}
