\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces F2: complete OLMoE graph matrices, 63 cells per format. Reductions use native at the same format and $B$. Every request has 128 prefix tokens and 2048 fixed outputs; TPOT excludes the first token. Logical-footprint ratios compare policies' realized trajectories via separate output-identical counted replays. They are neither DRAM savings nor same-route deletion fractions. One execution per arm supplies no independent-run uncertainty.}}{11}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
