\newlabel{fig:energy-r07}{{5}{11}{F4: gross whole-board J/decode-token from separate energy replays, integrated from NVML power samples. All 63 windows per format exceed three seconds: BF16 5.61--37.14\,s and FP8 5.39--28.36\,s. Prefill and the first token are excluded; the denominator is $2047B$ decode outputs. These single-run measurements are not process-only energy, task efficiency, or quality-matched comparisons}{figure.5}{}}
